Clearview Property Projects (operating commercially as CVP Property Projects) is a localized commercial and high-end residential trade service firm incorporated in January 2024. [1, 2]
Unlike large-scale corporate property developers who speculatively purchase broad swaths of city land, Clearview operates primarily as an agile, on-the-ground project team. They specialize in commercial renovations, corporate building maintenance, certified electrical/plumbing upgrades, structural painting, and specialized roof waterproofing throughout the Auckland region. [1, 2, 3]

Company Operations & Address

The business is rooted directly in the Eastern Bays community:
Physical Address: The operational headquarters and registered contact office for the firm is situated at 72A Allum Street, Kohimarama, Auckland 1071. [1, 2]
Core Team Leadership: The firm’s operations, client negotiations, and physical site delivery are led by its primary operator, Matthew, alongside a small, dedicated team of specialized trade workers. The company operates independently and builds its commercial profile on fast turnaround project execution, structural repairs, and eco-friendly property washdowns. [1, 2, 3]


